* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* ESFUNC-N - API Type: Functions Call
*
* XSETAA  2007-03-22  temporary recreated because removed from SAT
************************************************************************
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER USING ESMCNT-A
PARAMETER USING ESMINP-A
************************************************************************
LOCAL
1 #PROG-NAME (A8)
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
  WHEN ES-FUNCTION = 'EX'
    COMPRESS FULL ES-APPLICATION 'XXEX-N' TO #PROG-NAME LEAVING NO
  WHEN NONE
    COMPRESS FULL ES-APPLICATION ES-OBJECT ES-FRAMEWORK-FUNCTION '-N'
      TO #PROG-NAME LEAVING NO
END-DECIDE
CALLNAT #PROG-NAME ES-CONTROL ES-INPUT
*
END
